body": "Hello for the first time\nI really like your art work\nI would like to ask you about my white fox\nI want her to wear the dress in the photo\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/16vCji5fkt3sX7t9-iv3iHErUHG5Y-ODM?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hutomayuu/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c9442ddb/uploads/origins/7061f5e4-f2e8-4990-8b86-9cd5707c9954?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40fe8169e0650746313b7b55ca40f77a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c9442ddb/uploads/origins/7061f5e4-f2e8-4990-8b86-9cd5707c9954?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40fe8169e0650746313b7b55ca40f77a, https://si.imgix.net/c9442ddb/uploads/origins/7061f5e4-f2e8-4990-8b86-9cd5707c9954?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0de155dd281fc1d883a52b5f7584a0b9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c9442ddb/uploads/origins/7061f5e4-f2e8-4990-8b86-9cd5707c9954?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=33d5de48b268eef44684256d556cf5f1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "リベットとアンジェラ・クロス（『ラチェット＆クランク』）がこのセクシーな服を着ているファンアートをお願いします。\n\nリベットに巨乳を。\n\nリヴェットの衣装：https://skeb.jp/@hutomayuu/works/3\n\nアンジェラ用衣装: https://skeb.jp/@hutomayuu/works/2\n\n参考\nリベット（女性）：https://www.creativeuncut.com/gallery-41/rcra-rivet-render.html\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/hgBmpsB\n\nhttps://static1.e621.net/data/6d/5a/6d5a5db8494ed9ec3883bebdb9d2611e.png\n\nhttps://static1.e621.net/data/4a/14/4a14c627a3b2de3486747ccd73c8bf31.jpg\n\n(アンジェラの画像を見るには下にスクロールしてください)\nアンジェラ・クロス：https://imgur.com/a/INlANBG\n\nhttps://nl.ib.metapix.net/files/full/4599/4599189_darkfist_1443925-2.output.png\n\nhttps://qc.ib.metapix.net/files/full/4591/4591688_darkfist_1535188-1.output.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hutomayuu/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/abd5fcff/uploads/origins/d5724b94-040a-4f35-8c4b-04